# lazysite groups - the FILE FORMAT, for a sysop writing this store by hand.
#
# THIS FILE IS NOT COPIED BY THE INSTALLER, and no group or member here is
# real. Until SM865 the installer seeded `groups` from this file, which put an
# account called `manager` into lazysite-admins on every fresh install - see
# users.example for what that meant.
#
# You will not usually write this by hand. `setup-sysop` creates the admin
# group and the role and capability groups it needs, and the Groups page in the
# manager is where membership and capabilities are set, where the grant of each
# group can be seen while deciding.
#
# Format: groupname: user1, user2
#
#   members: alice, bob
#   editors: alice
#
# A group grants nothing by itself: capabilities are held in group settings
# (the Groups page), not here. This file records MEMBERSHIP only.
